1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:10,820
How was the plane able to clear the mountains?
飞机是怎样越过群山的？

2
00:00:10,820 --> 00:00:17,040
How was the plane able to clear the mountains?
飞机是怎样越过群山的？

3
00:00:19,730 --> 00:00:25,870
In 1929, three years after his flight over the North Pole,
1929年，在他飞越北极三年之后，

4
00:00:27,380 --> 00:00:30,790
the American explorer, R.E. Byrd,
美国探险家R.E.伯德

5
00:00:30,810 --> 00:00:35,570
successfully flew over the South Pole for the first time.
首次成功地飞越了南极。

6
00:00:36,220 --> 00:00:45,300
Though, at first, Byrd and his men were able to take a great many photographs of the mountains that lay below,
虽然开始时伯德和他的人拍到了下方群山的大量照片，

7
00:00:46,140 --> 00:00:48,890
they soon ran into serious trouble.
但他们很快就遇到了严重的麻烦。

8
00:00:49,840 --> 00:00:54,470
At one point, it seemed certain that their plane would crash.
在某个时刻，飞机似乎肯定要坠毁了。

9
00:00:55,230 --> 00:01:00,800
It could only get over the mountains if it rose to 10, 000 feet.
飞机只有升到10,000英尺的高度才能越过群山。

10
00:01:01,920 --> 00:01:07,210
Byrd at once ordered his men to throw out two heavy food sacks.
伯德立刻命令手下扔掉两个沉重的食物袋。

11
00:01:07,230 --> 00:01:14,830
The plane was then able to rise and it cleared the mountains by 400 feet.
飞机因此得以升高，以400英尺的高度越过了山头。

12
00:01:16,530 --> 00:01:23,100
Byrd now knew that he would be able to reach the South Pole which was 300 miles away,
伯德这时知道，他能够到达300英里外的南极，

13
00:01:23,250 --> 00:01:25,560
for there were no more mountains in sight.
因为眼前再没有山了。

14
00:01:26,840 --> 00:01:32,570
The aircraft was able to fly over the endless white plains without difficulty.
飞机顺利地飞越了无边无际的白色平原。
